frontend_not_active.description:
Energy Price Graph could not extend the Energy dashboard in your browser. This usually happens after a Home Assistant update (now {ha_version}) changed the internal frontend code the integration relies on. The Energy dashboard itself keeps working, just without the price graph.

Details: {error}

Check for an update of Energy Price Graph in HACS, or open an issue at {issue_tracker}. This message disappears by itself as soon as the price graph works again.
